  "prefLabel": "Per 102.99 Training",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 102.99 “Training” means an organized method of instruction designed to improve the working capacity and efficiency of an employee or the management skills of an employee or appointing authority.\n\nSource. #5373, eff 4-27-92; ss by #6729, eff 4-21-98; renumbered by #10238 (from Per 102.63); renumbered by #10801 (from Per 102.65); renumbered by #13667 (formerly Per 102.72); renumbered by #14065-A; renumbered by #14132-A; ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.88), eff 12-1-25",
